y County has 75 years of record from 1951 to 2025. January to February and August to September each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years on the middle, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle saw August to September at 53% and November to December at 47%. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 45% on the middle.</p>"}
